 Venustas is the light weight look of such an established piece! It fits perfectly and doesn’t look bulky! I also love how it has 3 temperatures! It is perfect for those long days at the barn where you have the super cold mornings to the warmer afternoons.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-51_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-52_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="a4866b2f-9466-4325-98ac-805607f9405d" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-caret-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Q4: How do you feel about Venustas heated apparel? </span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="a4866b2f-9466-4325-98ac-805607f9405d" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-54_"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-55_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-56_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-57_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-59_">A:&nbsp; I absolutely love Venustas heated apparel! It is totally life changing! I am naturally cold, but having this apparel makes me comfortable in even the coldest situations!</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-60_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-61_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="ac805607-f940-4d66-9ed0-869e08db747f" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-caret-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Q5: The reason to be our V+ Master.</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="ac805607-f940-4d66-9ed0-869e08db747f" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-63_"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-64_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--